{"2322450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mining Survivors", "steam_appid": 2322450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining Survivors is an incremental game in which you mine resources whilst fending of swarms of enemies in a bullet-heaven environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.poster.avif?t=1770422298\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.webm?t=1770422298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.mp4?t=1770422298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You mine resources in short bursts, before either dying to enemies or fending them off long enough to escape with extra rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You then return to the shop, where you spend your resources to upgrade your character and unlock new levels and areas to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/99872caa8233fed7796dea23de049a8a.poster.avif?t=1770422298\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/99872caa8233fed7796dea23de049a8a.webm?t=1770422298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/99872caa8233fed7796dea23de049a8a.mp4?t=1770422298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vi